\f0\fs24 \cf0 # Project: ECNL Boys Schedule Tracker\
## Architecture\
- `/db`: Dockerized PostgreSQL 16 (managed via root `docker-compose.yml`).\
- `/api`: Python 3.12+ FastAPI microservice using SQLAlchemy/SQLModel and Pydantic. Runs on port 8000.\
- `/web`: Next.js (App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Lucide icons). Runs on port 3000.\
\
## Domain Model (ECNL Boys)\
- Teams have: `id`, `club_name` (e.g., "Sporting Jax", "Concorde Fire"), `age_group` (e.g., "B2012", "U14"), `conference` (e.g., "Southeast").\
- Games have: `id`, `date`, `time`, `home_team_id`, `away_team_id`, `complex_name`, `field_number`, `city_state`, `is_showcase` (boolean).\
- Note: A single team lookup must query games where the team is EITHER `home_team_id` OR `away_team_id`, and compute a dynamic field `venue_type` ("Home", "Away", or "Neutral/Showcase") relative to the looked-up team.}